Subject: [PATCH AUTOSEL 4.9 05/45] tty: serial: cpm_uart - fix init when SMC is relocated
Date:   Fri, 19 Jul 2019 00:12:24 -0400
Message-Id: <20190719041304.18849-5-sashal@kernel.org>
